<item>
  <title>HidrAmazônia presented at EcoFoG on 16 October</title>
  <link>https://hidramazonia.github.io/news/261014_flavia_ecofog/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<section id="summary" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="summary">Summary</h2>
<p>On <strong>16 October 2026</strong>, the <a href="https://umr-ecofog.cirad.fr/">UMR EcoFoG</a> hosts two scientific conferences “from Brasil” by <strong>Flavia Costa</strong> and <strong>Alberto Vicentini</strong>: <em>HydrAmazonia Project</em> and <em>Beyond Species Names</em>. This is a good opportunity to discover <strong>HidrAmazônia</strong>, our Franco-Brazilian project on how Amazonian forests cope with droughts and floods.</p>
</section>
<section id="practical-information" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="practical-information">Practical information</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Date:</strong> Friday 16 October 2026, 11:00 (Cayenne time)</li>
<li><strong>Place:</strong> Campus agronomique, Silvolab room</li>
<li><strong>Format:</strong> in person and online</li>
<li><strong>Programme:</strong> <em>HydrAmazonia Project</em> &amp; <em>Beyond Species Names</em></li>
<li><strong>Speakers:</strong> Flavia Costa and Alberto Vicentini</li>
</ul>
<p>More details are available on the <a href="https://umr-ecofog.cirad.fr/science-pour-tous/animations-scientifiques/deux-presentations-16-10-2026">EcoFoG event page</a>.</p>
